Hi; another Ascension post!  

For a while I had considered doing this as a non-wizard extinctionist,
but I came to realize that was unrealistic.  Since I was playing on a
public server, I was afraid that a version upgrade would come long
before I could finish this game.  So I abandonded "extinctionist", but 
I managed to keep "Genoless and Polyselfless" plus never died.  

Yes, I farmed black and brown puddings, but by the time I started that,
I would have been ready for the planes anyway.  The RNG gave me a sink
and an altar on the last level before medusa -- what else was I supposed
to do?

I learned this time around that Demogorgon is unlikely to appear in the
game unless one of the Demon princes gates him in.  Supposedly
Arch-Liches and Rodney will do it, but I spent enough time with those
guys, and no Demorgoron.  This was another factor in my choosing not to
do Extinctionist. 

At the end of the game, I wished up an Ice Box, but it had dragon
corpses, so no YAID this time.  I did ascend with a black pudding
corpse, for the demigod bar feast.


